    "All stage x coordinates use their recorded step_start_s; native points use actual saved clocks. No phase time shift/regridding/filtering.",
    "RHS Pre then pressure half update then Pre material/plane, then Cor RHS then Cor material/plane then full pressure update/ponding. Cor return cannot cause its already formed RHS; Pre return may affect Cor force.",
